        "颜色格式无效；请输入 #RRGGBB 或 ##RRGGBB 六位十六进制颜色" => "Invalid color. Enter six hexadecimal digits as #RRGGBB or ##RRGGBB.",
        "界面缩放已设为 85%" => "UI scale set to 85%",
