        "已启用 Android 预测返回手势" => "Android predictive back is enabled",
        "已关闭 Android 预测返回手势" => "Android predictive back is disabled",
        "预测返回手势仅适用于 Android" => "Predictive back is available on Android only",
        "系统手势预览需要 Android 14 或更高版本" => "System gesture previews require Android 14 or later",
        "已隐藏 Android 最近任务中的应用卡片" => "Lumen is hidden from Android Recents",
        "已显示 Android 最近任务中的应用卡片" => "Lumen is shown in Android Recents",
        "流量通知仅适用于 Android" => "Traffic notifications are available on Android only",
        "需要允许 Lumen 通知权限，才能在通知栏显示流量速率" => "Allow Lumen notifications to show traffic rates",
